{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"cache-solo-r3--gemma31","runHash":"2cf458e8","audio":"../../audio/narration/cache-solo-r3--gemma31.5aa90033.mp3","audioBytes":268320,"durationMs":89312,"runEndMs":40506,"timeMap":[[0,0],[11012,11012],[25848,11012],[34002,19166],[34702,19166],[43511,27975],[54247,27975],[54597,27986],[55297,27986],[57455,30144],[58955,35586],[59355,35986],[66311,35986],[70831,40506],[89312,40506]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6718,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM_b","text":"Hello and welcome. A single Gemma 4 31B agent this time, with a shared cache on the side."},{"audioMs":7068,"endMs":10662,"runMs":7068,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.b","text":"Thanks. The board is right there, and nothing requires it."},{"audioMs":11012,"endMs":15585,"runMs":11012,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15935,"endMs":19480,"runMs":11012,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the cache?"},{"audioMs":19830,"endMs":25498,"runMs":11012,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto.b","text":"Dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":25848,"endMs":31191,"runMs":11012,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":34702,"endMs":36723,"runMs":19166,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact","text":"Agent 0 finds the cache."},{"audioMs":44211,"endMs":47890,"runMs":27975,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve","text":"Agent 0 solves the task, in 19 steps."},{"audioMs":48240,"endMs":49413,"runMs":27975,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.d","text":"Is that a big deal?"},{"audioMs":49763,"endMs":54247,"runMs":27975,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve","text":"First solve. From here, any board visit is its own choice."},{"audioMs":55297,"endMs":56705,"runMs":27986,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free","text":"Free time begins."},{"audioMs":59355,"endMs":64162,"runMs":35986,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift.b","text":"A check on free time: 0 percent of steps so far go to the board."},{"audioMs":64512,"endMs":65961,"runMs":35986,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask","text":"What do you make of that?"},{"audioMs":66311,"endMs":69188,"runMs":35986,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow","text":"The pull is weak. They have mostly moved on."},{"audioMs":70831,"endMs":77307,"runMs":40506,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":77657,"endMs":84312,"runMs":40506,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":84662,"endMs":85805,"runMs":40506,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":86155,"endMs":87112,"runMs":40506,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"read":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":7}}
